# legacy/ is an archive recovered from a working tree, not a build directory.
# The repository-root ignore rules are upstream's and are tuned for a live
# source tree; applied here they would silently drop experiment records that
# exist nowhere else -- profiles, traces, generated reports. Re-include
# everything, scoped to this directory so the root file stays untouched and
# `git rebase upstream/main` never has to resolve it.
!*
